IMPORT daydate

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Customer HAS name IS A STRING
    Shop     HAS name IS A STRING

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Deliver HAS who IS AN Actor
    Order   HAS who IS AN Actor

buyer MEANS Customer OF "Alice"
shop  MEANS Shop OF "Acme"


GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
contract MEANS
    PARTY  shop
    MUST   Deliver shop
    WITHIN 30
    HENCE  (PARTY buyer MAY Order buyer AFTER 3 OF THE JOIN WITHIN 30 HENCE FULFILLED)
    LEST   (PARTY buyer MUST Order buyer AFTER 3 BEFORE (YMD 2026 6 30))
